{"term":{"label":"道","occurrences":16,"variants":[]},"source":{"id":"3B","url":"https://ctext.org/mengzi/teng-wen-gong-ii","title":"滕文公下","description":"陳代曰：「不見諸侯，宜若小然；今一見之，大則以王，小則以霸。且志曰：『枉尺而直尋』，宜若可為也。」\n孟子曰：「昔齊景公田，招虞人以旌，不至，將殺之。志士不忘在溝壑，勇士不忘喪其元。孔子奚取焉？取非其招不往也，如不待其招而往，何哉？且夫枉尺而直尋者，以利言也。如以利，則枉尋直尺而利，亦可為與？昔者趙簡子使王良與嬖奚乘，終"},"network":{"directed":false,"multigraph":false,"graph":{},"nodes":[{"form":"一","id":"一"},{"form":"下","id":"下"},{"form":"何","id":"何"},{"form":"又","id":"又"},{"form":"君子","id":"君子"},{"form":"墨","id":"墨"},{"form":"天","id":"天"},{"form":"孔子","id":"孔子"},{"form":"往","id":"往"},{"form":"惡","id":"惡"},{"form":"枉","id":"枉"},{"form":"楊","id":"楊"},{"form":"由","id":"由"},{"form":"聖","id":"聖"},{"form":"行","id":"行"},{"form":"道","id":"道"}],"edges":[{"weight":1.5455341104546203,"source":"聖","target":"道"},{"weight":1.882006347075833,"source":"聖","target":"墨"},{"weight":1.882006347075833,"source":"聖","target":"楊"},{"weight":1.9873668627336596,"source":"枉","target":"何"},{"weight":1.5455341104546203,"source":"枉","target":"道"},{"weight":2.798297078949988,"source":"又","target":"惡"},{"weight":2.2874714551839976,"source":"又","target":"由"},{"weight":1.2578520380028393,"source":"又","target":"道"},{"weight":1.6996847902818786,"source":"又","target":"行"},{"weight":1.1243206453783166,"source":"又","target":"下"},{"weight":1.1243206453783166,"source":"又","target":"天"},{"weight":0.3133904291619879,"source":"行","target":"下"},{"weight":0.3133904291619879,"source":"行","target":"天"},{"weight":1.140069002346456,"source":"行","target":"道"},{"weight":1.4765412389676689,"source":"行","target":"由"},{"weight":2.4460764853606363,"source":"下","target":"天"},{"weight":0.5647048574428939,"source":"下","target":"道"},{"weight":0.9011770940641068,"source":"下","target":"墨"},{"weight":0.9011770940641068,"source":"下","target":"楊"},{"weight":1.4765412389676689,"source":"君子","target":"何"},{"weight":1.727855667248575,"source":"君子","target":"道"},{"weight":1.0347084866886296,"source":"孔子","target":"道"},{"weight":0.90117709